  "prefLabel": "Cla 201.12 Party",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Cla 201.12 \"Party\" means \"party\" as defined by RSA 541-A:1, XII, namely, \"each person or agency named or admitted as a party, or properly seeking and entitled as a right to be admitted as a party.\"\n\nSource. #8509, eff 12-09-05",
